  Disabled/boundary-unavailable actions are visibly muted and cannot alter the value.
  Both themes remain readable; all existing bounds, step sizes and live bindings are retained.
  No baseline is drawn beyond the mode buttons; the minimal front README remains intact.
  Vector assets are included in installed resources and current snapshots.

